## Native Haptics Plugin

Provide tactile physical feedback to users using iOS `UIImpactFeedbackGenerator` and Android `Vibrator` / `VibrationEffect` API.

### Installation

```bash
wefter add @wefterjs/haptics
```

### Usage Example

```typescript
import { invokeNative } from "@wefterjs/core";

// Trigger light impact haptic
await invokeNative("haptics", "impact", { style: "light" });

// Trigger notification haptic pattern
await invokeNative("haptics", "notification", { type: "success" });
```

## QR Code & Barcode Scanner Plugin

High-performance camera QR code scanning backed by Google ML Kit Vision on Android and AVFoundation metadata output on iOS.

### Installation

```bash
wefter add @wefterjs/scanner
```

### Usage Example

```typescript
import { invokeNative } from "@wefterjs/core";

const scan = await invokeNative<{ text: string; format: string }>(
  "scanner",
  "startScan"
);

console.log("Scanned content:", scan.text);
```

## Encrypted Secure Storage Plugin

Persist sensitive auth tokens, encryption keys, and credentials securely using Android `EncryptedSharedPreferences` and iOS `Keychain`.

### Installation

```bash
wefter add @wefterjs/secure-storage
```

### Usage Example

```typescript
import { invokeNative } from "@wefterjs/core";

// Write token to secure keychain
await invokeNative("secureStorage", "set", {
  key: "jwt_token",
  value: "ey..."
});

// Read token
const item = await invokeNative<{ value: string }>("secureStorage", "get", {
  key: "jwt_token"
});
```
